            "displayName": "Oleg Kalnichevski",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "body": "No objections from me. I believe it is good to be included into 2.0 release as \nwell. \n\nOleg ",
          "updateAuthor": {
